1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:07,500
As the sun rises over the highland hills, the memories of our ancestors whisper through the wind.

2
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:15,000
Each day is a fresh blessing; each morning carries a new story waiting to be told.

3
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:20,961
Coffee cannot be rushed; like life itself, it asks for patience and mindful care.

4
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:29,221
Just as the beans release their richest aroma through heat, human character discovers its strength through trials.

5
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:35,001
Receive this aroma; it is the fragrance of peace and togetherness.

6
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:41,661
The steady rhythm of each strike echoes the heartbeat of our community.

7
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:51,561
The water simmering within the Jebena carries the flow of wisdom from generation to generation.

8
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:58,741
As the incense ascends toward heaven, it carries the quiet prayers of our mothers.

9
00:01:00,150 --> 00:01:06,121
When we gather to drink as one, our differences dissolve, and love reigns.

10
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:13,821
Heritage is our true essence; hold it closely, and pass its light to your children.
